From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: recognize A830 revision 1 with a mainline speed bin

The mainline MSM ioctl includes the speed bin in bits 47:32. The existing
KGSL entry matches only a zero upper word. Backport the wildcard-fuse entry
from the newer upstream device table; all GPU properties remain unchanged.
Source: mesa/mesa f1ec46beaa6739fb15de953e6f4dc679b4e8c07f

--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -1382,6 +1382,7 @@
 
 add_gpus([
         GPUId(chip_id=0xffff44050000, name="Adreno (TM) 830"),
+        GPUId(chip_id=0xffff44050001, name="Adreno (TM) 830v1"),
         GPUId(chip_id=0x44050001, name="Adreno (TM) 830"), # KGSL
     ], A6xxGPUInfo(
         CHIP.A8XX,
